panels.description:
Node memory split as in the node-exporter mixin "Memory Usage" panel
(https://github.com/prometheus/node_exporter/tree/master/docs/node-mixin/dashboards/node.libsonnet): used (by processes) = MemTotal - MemFree - Buffers - Cached; buffers; page cache;
free. Page cache shrinks automatically when processes need memory, so a big cache is good, not a problem.
